---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SponsorStrip from '@/components/SponsorStrip.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About &amp; Contact" description="About the Computational Fluids and Aerodynamics Laboratory (CFAL) at Embry-Riddle Aeronautical University, and how to get in touch.">
  <section class="container-lab py-16 max-w-3xl">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-(--color-blue-600)">About</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl">About CFAL</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-(--color-slate-600)">
      CFAL, the Computational Fluids and Aerodynamics Laboratory at Embry-Riddle, develops computational and experimental tools for complex aerospace and multiphysics flow problems, with an emphasis on environments where conventional aerodynamic models become difficult to apply.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 card p-6">
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">Lab Director</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 font-semibold">Michael Kinzel</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-(--color-slate-600)">Associate Professor, Department of Aerospace Engineering, College of Engineering, Embry-Riddle Aeronautical University</p>
      <a href="/people/michael-kinzel" class="mt-3 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-(--color-blue-600) hover:underline">Full profile →</a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="card p-6">
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold">Location</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-(--color-slate-600)">
          Department of Aerospace Engineering<br />
          College of Engineering<br />
          Embry-Riddle Aeronautical University<br />
          Daytona Beach, Florida
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-6">
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold">Contact</h2>
        <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm">
          <li><a class="font-semibold text-(--color-blue-600) hover:underline" href="mailto:kinzelm@erau.edu">kinzelm@erau.edu</a></li>
          <li><a class="font-semibold text-(--color-blue-600) hover:underline" href="https://erau.edu/faculty/Michael.Kinzel" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ERAU Faculty Profile ↗</a></li>
          <li><a class="font-semibold text-(--color-blue-600) hover:underline" href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=LI9BgQkAAAAJ&hl=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Scholar ↗</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Equipment &amp; Facilities</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="card p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold">Vega High-Performance Computing Cluster</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-(--color-slate-600)">ERAU's primary on-premise supercomputing resource for large-scale CFD, multiphysics, and parallel computing: 42 compute nodes (dual AMD EPYC 9654 96-core CPUs, 1.5 TB RAM each), 8 NVIDIA H100 GPUs across two GPU nodes, 100 Gb InfiniBand networking, and roughly 1 PB each of scratch and user storage, supporting 100+ scientific software packages.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold">Dedicated GPU Workstations</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-(--color-slate-600)">Two high-end workstations for local CFD, AI/ML, reduced-order modeling, and GPU code development, each with 256 GB system RAM and an NVIDIA RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell GPU (96 GB GPU memory), for rapid-turnaround computing without cluster scheduling.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold">Microgravity and Balloon Payload Workspace</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-(--color-slate-600)">A dedicated build and integration area for microgravity experiments, high-altitude balloon payloads, sensors, electronics, and prototype hardware, supporting assembly, checkout, and preparation prior to field or flight testing.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Sponsors &amp; Collaborators</h2>
      <SponsorStrip />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
